#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:7
msgid "Saving rendered images and 3D re-projection"
msgstr "保存渲染图像和 3D 重投影"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:11
msgid ""
"This guide accompanied with the ``run_usd_camera.py`` script in the "
"``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/04_sensors`` directory."
msgstr ""
"这个指南与 ``run_usd_camera.py`` 脚本一起使用，位于 "
"``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/04_sensors`` 目录中。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:0
msgid "Code for run_usd_camera.py"
msgstr "run_usd_camera.py 的代码"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:24
msgid "Saving the images to file"
msgstr "将图像保存到文件"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:26
msgid ""
"To save camera outputs, we use the "
":func:`~isaaclab.sensors.camera.utils.save_images_to_file` utility. It "
"writes a batch of images as a PNG file and does not depend on the renderer "
"backend. The script creates the output folder once, before the simulation "
"loop:"
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`~isaaclab.sensors.camera.utils.save_images_to_file` "
"工具保存相机输出。它将一批图像写入 PNG 文件，不依赖渲染后端。脚本在仿真循环开始前一次性创建输出目录："

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:35
msgid ""
"While stepping the simulator, the outputs of the camera at ``camera_index`` "
"are saved once per data type and frame: 8-bit color outputs (the RGB image "
"and the colorized segmentations) as PNG files, and floating-point outputs, "
"such as depth and normals, as NumPy ``.npy`` files."
msgstr ""
"推进仿真器时，对 ``camera_index`` 指定的相机，按每种数据类型、每帧保存一次输出：8 位彩色输出（RGB 图像和彩色分割图）保存为 "
"PNG；深度和法线等浮点输出保存为 NumPy ``.npy`` 文件。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:46
msgid "Projection into 3D Space"
msgstr "投影到 3D 空间"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:48
msgid ""
"We include utilities to project the depth image into 3D Space. The re-"
"projection operations are done using PyTorch operations which allows faster "
"computation."
msgstr "我们包含实用程序来将深度图像投影到 3D 空间。重新投影操作使用 PyTorch 操作来进行，这可以加快计算速度。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:62
msgid ""
"Alternately, we can use the "
":meth:`isaaclab.sensors.camera.utils.create_pointcloud_from_depth` function "
"to create a point cloud from the depth image and transform it to the world "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"或者，我们可以使用 :meth:`isaaclab.sensors.camera.utils.create_pointcloud_from_depth`"
" 函数从深度图像创建点云，并将其转换为世界框架。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:70
msgid ""
"The resulting point cloud can be visualized using "
":class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers`. This makes it easy to "
"visualize the point cloud in the 3D space."
msgstr ""
"通过 :class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers` ，可方便地在三维空间中显示生成的点云。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:80
msgid "Executing the script"
msgstr "执行脚本"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:82
msgid "To run the accompanying script, execute the following command:"
msgstr "要运行附带的脚本，请执行以下命令: "

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:93
msgid ""
"The simulation should start, and you can observe different objects falling "
"down. An output folder will be created in the "
"``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/04_sensors`` directory, where the images will "
"be saved as PNG files. Additionally, you should see the point cloud in the "
"3D space drawn on the viewport."
msgstr ""
"仿真开始后，可以观察不同物体下落。脚本会在 ``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/04_sensors`` "
"目录下创建输出文件夹，将图像保存为 PNG。同时，视口中应显示绘制在三维空间中的点云。"

#: source/how-to/save_camera_output.rst:97
msgid ""
"To stop the simulation, close the window, or use ``Ctrl+C`` in the terminal."
msgstr "要停止仿真，关闭窗口，或在终端中使用 ``Ctrl+C`` 。"
